  "notes": [
    "Setup: Player A is in MAIN_PHASE with 0 active energy. Player A has 3 Link Units in play: GD01-005 (Lv.5, name includes \"Unicorn Mode\"), GD03-016 (Lv.5, name includes \"Unicorn Mode\"), and GD03-010 (NOT valid: name is \"Destroy Mode\" and Lv.8). Player A has GD01-002 in hand.",
    "Action (manual): Player A plays GD01-002 from hand into an empty slot.",
    "Expect: On-play optional cost asks to destroy 1 of your Link Units that (a) has \"Unicorn Mode\" in its card name and (b) is Lv.5. Only GD01-005 and GD03-016 are selectable; GD03-010 is not selectable (negative case).",
    "Expect: If Player A destroys a valid target, GD01-002 is played as if it has 0 Lv. and 0 cost (should be playable even with 0 active energy). The destroyed Unit moves to Player A trashArea and Player A energyArea remains unchanged.",
    "Follow-up (manual): After GD01-002 is in play, proceed to ATTACK_PHASE and attack to trigger GD01-002 [Attack]. Choose 1 enemy Unit and rest it (Player B slot1 unit is provided as a target)."
  ],
